Subject: [PATCH 220/371] pirates: the Sea Battle can call a truce, and admins
 get siege magic words (0296)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 pirates/pvp/SeaBattleManagerAI.py | 101 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 101 insertions(+)

diff --git a/pirates/pvp/SeaBattleManagerAI.py b/pirates/pvp/SeaBattleManagerAI.py
index a8bfabb..121f17c 100644
--- a/pirates/pvp/SeaBattleManagerAI.py
